WEBVTT

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:04.650
After Yuya's duel gave everyone shivers...

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.620
Sora's match began.

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.990
His opponent was LDS's Syun Kurosaki.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:13.620
But he's the culprit who attacked LDS.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:16.460
Why is he now on LDS's side?

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.640
Battle, Raidraptor - Rise Falcon!

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:30.540
Tear apart all your enemies!  
Brave Claw Revolution!

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.380
What you did was interesting.

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:46.080
In that case, I'll also become 
a little more serious.

00:00:49.620 --> 00:00:54.900
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:00:55.370 --> 00:01:00.060
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:03.110
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.310
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:10.040
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.710
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:15.540
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:26.630
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:32.100
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:37.730
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:41.840
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.780
Repeating Up/Down

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:48.140
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:55.390
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:58.850
Because I don't want to give up

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:03.830
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:10.930
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:21.440
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:24.120
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:26.820
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:29.620
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:32.390
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:42.010
Merged Magical Beast vs Evolving Falcon

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:48.510
Due to Kurosaki's attack, Sora 
Shiunin instantly lost his monsters!

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:50.880
Can he counterattack?

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.990
My turn.  I draw!

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:57.960
I summon Edge Imp Saw.

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:03.850
When it's successfully summoned,

00:03:03.850 --> 00:03:09.300
I can send a Fluffal monster in my hand 
to the graveyard to draw two cards.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:15.440
I activate the spell card Fusion 
Conscription from my hand.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:19.140
I add Fusion Material Monsters 
from my deck to my hand.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:25.020
Good.  Now my preparations are complete.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:30.040
Watch closely!  Put a spotlight on me!

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:34.190
The fun is only getting started!

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:38.660
Whoa!  He used Sakaki's catchphrase!

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:40.540
That guy...

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:42.900
He likes you.

00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:47.640
I activate the Continuous Spell 
Frightfur Factory from my hand!

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:51.320
I banish Polymerization from my graveyard

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:54.680
to Fusion Summon one Frightfur monster.

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:59.360
I fuse Edge Imp Saw and 
Fluffal Leo in my hand!

00:04:04.280 --> 00:04:05.720
It's Mr. Lion!

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:07.300
How cute!

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:10.190
The steel teeth that house the devil,

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:15.500
become one with the beast that bears its 
fangs and show your new power and look!

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:17.400
Fusion Summon!

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:21.940
Appear, the king of beasts 
that slashes everything!

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:24.510
Frightfur Leo!

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.820
I'm scared!

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:36.860
Whoa!  Kurosaki turned his back on him!

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:39.560
Are you scared?

00:04:44.780 --> 00:04:46.800
It's pointless to run away.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.670
Frightfur Leo's effect activates!

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.640
Once per turn, it destroys your monster,

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:56.420
and you take damage equal 
to its attack points!

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.520
I activate the Action Spell Mirror Barrier!

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:18.360
Your card's destruction effect is negated!

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:35.640
He's even mastered Action Cards.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:37.820
He wasn't just running away.

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:44.220
He used Raidraptor - Return 
before and Mirror Barrier now.

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:50.100
He's an expert on trap and spell cards.

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:54.230
He must have acquired those 
skills in actual combat

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:57.280
during his battles as the Resistance.

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:01.170
Do it, Frightfur Leo!

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:15.500
Even though it's Solid Vision, you shouldn't 
destroy things indiscriminately.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:20.370
Sorry, but felines don't 
like to move backwards.

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:21.330
What?

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:33.710
But it has allowed me to find the 
true enemy that I must destroy.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:41.980
You thought you protected yourself 
with the Action Card, but too bad.

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:45.420
You can't escape from the king of 
beasts that slashes everything.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:48.330
Leo has 2400 attack points,

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:51.920
so if it destroys a monster with 100 
attack points, you'll take big damage.

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:53.390
Let's battle!

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:56.860
Frightfur Leo, attack Rise Falcon!

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:03.240
I activate the trap Adversity.

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:08.060
When you attack my monster that 
has less attack points than yours,

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:14.120
destruction and damage is negated, 
and it gains 1000 attack points.

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:16.620
What?

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:19.080
Another trap!

00:07:19.270 --> 00:07:23.280
He repelled Frightfur Leo with his set card!

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:27.290
And he increased his own 
monster's attack points!

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:30.530
Impressive.  We can use him.

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:35.640
Damn!  I'll definitely destroy it next time!

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.540
I end my turn!

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:39.970
Sora is usually relaxed, but...

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:43.200
I've never seen him irritated before.

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:44.920
Don't lose your cool, Sora!

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:47.750
Even if your heart burns, 
your head must remain cool!

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:49.820
Only fire up your heart!

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:53.260
Don't worry!  I haven't lost my cool!

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:55.040
I'm having fun!

00:07:58.280 --> 00:07:59.560
My turn!

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:02.530
I activate Rise Falcon's effect.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.900
By using one Overlay Unit,

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:12.760
it gains your Special Summoned monster's 
attack points until the End Phase.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:14.570
Let's battle!

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:17.980
Rise Falcon attacks Frightfur Leo!

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:20.480
I won't let you do that!

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:23.820
The Action Spell Evasion!

00:08:23.820 --> 00:08:27.790
That's pointless.  I activate 
the Counter Trap Raptor's Storm.

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:34.260
When Raidraptor is on the field, your spell 
or trap card's activation is negated.

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:44.670
Sora!

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:48.060
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:53.650
Rise Falcon's effect now ends, so 
its attack points return to normal.

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:56.100
Are you okay, Sora?

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:59.850
Sheesh, he is really annoying.

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:04.090
How many of my monsters has he destroyed?

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:09.350
I won't just be a little serious 
anymore.  I'll be fully serious!

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:12.530
My turn!

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:16.500
I activate the spell card Suture Rebirth!

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:20.240
I Special Summon Fluffal 
Sheep from my graveyard!

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:28.550
Then I activate the Continuous 
Spell Frightfur Factory's effect!

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:32.420
I banish a card with "Fusion" 
in its name from my graveyard

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.890
to Fusion Summon one Frightfur monster!

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:41.400
I fuse Fluffal Sheep on my field 
with Edge Imp Chain in my hand!

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.260
Fusion Summon!

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:47.400
Appear!

00:09:47.640 --> 00:09:50.340
The chain beast the seals away everything!

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:53.320
Frightfur Sheep!

00:09:55.120 --> 00:10:00.510
When this monster attacks, you 
can't activate spell or trap cards!

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:03.720
I've sealed away your best tactics.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.950
But will that be enough?

00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:09.990
Let's battle!  Go, Frightfur Sheep!

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:12.680
Attack Rise Falcon!

00:10:22.900 --> 00:10:24.080
He did it!

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:28.470
Since his spells and traps are 
sealed away, he can't do anything!

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:31.240
Impressive as usual, Sora!  I'm shivering!

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:44.740
Your monster's attack is over.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:47.310
That means its effect is gone.

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:48.390
What?

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:52.900
I activate the Quick-Play Spell 
Rank-Up-Magic Raptor's Force!

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:57.600
It Special Summons Rise Falcon 
that was destroyed in battle,

00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:01.070
and it ranks up into a Raidraptor 
that's one Rank higher.

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:02.460
What?

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:11.750
Ferocious falcon, cut through 
fierce battles and flap your wings

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:13.620
to defeat your approaching enemies!

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:17.260
Rank Up Xyz Change!  Appear!

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:22.460
Rank 5 Raidraptor - Blaze Falcon!

00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:33.610
Whoa!  The Xyz Monster is 
supposed to be destroyed,

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:36.440
but it's been reborn at a higher Rank!

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:39.000
Rank up...

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:43.900
I haven't learned that Xyz Summon at school!

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:45.870
He's on a different level than you.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:47.890
No, he's on a different rank!

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:55.590
Nice!

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:58.680
You're quite the entertainer yourself!

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:03.070
Thanks for firing up the 
crowd!  They're very happy!

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:06.970
I'm getting excited too.

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:09.100
I can't help enjoying this.

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:11.280
I end my turn.

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:15.900
Now keep entertaining me.

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:22.220
Entertain?  You're only going 
to taste agony and pain!

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:25.190
My turn!

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:27.780
I activate Blaze Falcon's effect!

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:34.510
By using one Overlay Unit, your Special 
Summoned monsters are destroyed,

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:38.680
and you take 500 points 
of damage for each one!

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:43.580
Whoa!  What a ruthless effect!

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:49.580
I flip over my trap card Frightfur Defender!

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:55.550
My Frightfur monster's destruction is 
negated, and it gains 800 attack points!

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:04.430
Shiunin stops it with a trap card!

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:08.400
And he even increased his 
monster's attack points!

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:11.140
All right!  Nice response, Sora!

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:13.340
But the city...

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:28.400
Blaze Falcon can attack you directly.  Go!

00:13:29.600 --> 00:13:34.000
Kurosaki continues the pressure!  
Shiunin is in a pinch!

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:46.970
The building is collapsing!  Watch out!

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:47.940
Sora!

00:13:55.360 --> 00:13:56.400
Wow.

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.620
How can he move like that?

00:14:06.100 --> 00:14:13.560
When Blaze Falcon deals direct damage, 
one of your monsters is destroyed.

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:17.370
I won't let you!

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:21.640
I activate the Action Spell Mirror Barrier!

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:24.540
Your card's destruction effect is negated!

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:29.020
He protected himself with 
an Action Spell this time!

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:32.850
It's the same Mirror Barrier 
that Kurosaki used previously!

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:36.120
I flip over my trap card Raptor's Gust!

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:42.330
When a Raidraptor is on my field, your 
spell's activation is negated and destroyed!

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:46.130
He turned the tables again!

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:50.870
All right!  He finally 
put an end to that sheep!

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:53.600
He sets a trap to prepare in advance.

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:55.610
That's how Kurosaki duels!

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:58.040
If you're struck, then strike right back!

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:02.900
The fierce clashes are exciting the crowd!

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:08.290
This is just like a battlefield.

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:13.240
I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:16.260
What happened to your smirk?

00:15:19.540 --> 00:15:22.600
Now do you know how it feels to be hunted?

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:30.910
You were always laughing when 
you attacked my friends.

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:35.780
But we're no longer prey that won't resist!

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:40.020
Sora's team attacked?  
What is he talking about?

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:42.880
What?  I'm no longer relaxed?

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:44.520
Stop joking around.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:48.530
I can win this duel while eating candy.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:56.600
This is all for fun.  I don't 
need to take it seriously.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.820
Even my teammates feel the same.

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:02.680
We're hunting you for fun.

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:07.980
Because all you are is 
prey in our hunting game!

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:10.660
Prey?  Game?

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:12.350
What's he talking about?

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:16.790
My turn!

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:21.490
I activate the spell card Frightfur Fusion!

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:27.370
I banish Frightfur Bear, Leo 
and Sheep from my graveyard

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:32.820
to Fusion Summon a Frightfur monster 
that requires those three cards!

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:38.940
The inanimate toy that houses the devil, 
annihilate the fools who oppose me!

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:41.910
Fusion Summon!

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:46.120
Appear, the magical beast that's 
a combination of all toys!

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:48.640
Frightfur Chimera!

00:16:57.660 --> 00:16:58.960
Let's battle!

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:02.600
Frightfur Chimera, attack Blaze Falcon!

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:15.550
Frightfur Chimera's effect activates.

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:20.520
When it destroys a monster, it's summoned 
on to my field from your graveyard.

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:26.540
For every monster that I take 
control of using this effect,

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:30.700
Frightfur Chimera gains 300 attack points.

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:36.140
Even your monster belongs to me.

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:40.460
Do you get it now?  You can't hunt me.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:45.600
You're the ones who will 
be hunted for eternity!

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:48.720
What is he talking about?

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:50.060
Sora...

00:17:50.800 --> 00:17:55.760
I'll make sure to finish 
you with your own monster.

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:58.040
Since you only have 400 life points left,

00:17:58.040 --> 00:18:02.980
if Blaze Falcon attacks you directly 
for 1000 points of damage...

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:04.200
How ridiculous.

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.030
What?

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:11.070
We, the Resistance, always battle 
assuming the worst possible situations.

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:15.700
We even think about our teammates 
being taken by the enemy.

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:22.150
But even if they're taken, 
we never forsake them.

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:25.520
We always get our teammates back!

00:18:28.100 --> 00:18:29.320
What's with his eyes?

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:36.520
I activate the Quick-Play Spell 
Rank-Up-Magic Revolution Force!

00:18:38.120 --> 00:18:41.660
I take control of one Xyz 
Monster on your field.

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:47.170
I rank it up to a Raidraptor 
that's one Rank higher.

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:48.670
What?

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:54.510
Proud falcon, flap your wings that 
are stained with the blood of heroes

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:56.850
and travel the path of revolution!

00:18:57.180 --> 00:18:59.860
Rank Up Xyz Change!

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:06.000
Appear, Rank 6 Raidraptor 
- Revolution Falcon!

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:13.870
Incredible!  Kurosaki's Xyz 
Monster ranked up again!

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:16.720
Watch closely, Layra.

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:19.980
For our future.

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:31.460
You were talking about a revolution, 
but it only has 2000 attack points.

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:36.480
It can't destroy my Frightfur Chimera 
that has 2800 attack points!

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:37.790
Are you sure about that?

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:43.060
You're bluffing.

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:47.770
You have no more set cards on your field.

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:50.120
Stop!  Don't provoke him!

00:19:50.340 --> 00:19:52.740
He's dangerous!  He's serious!

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:56.480
Revolution Falcon's effect activates!

00:19:56.900 --> 00:20:04.140
When it ranks up using a Raidraptor, it 
destroys your Special Summoned monster,

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:07.140
and you take damage equal 
to half its attack points.

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:08.090
What?

00:20:08.490 --> 00:20:11.060
Go, Revolution Falcon!

00:20:14.030 --> 00:20:16.940
Burn in the fires of revolution and perish!

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:25.340
Stop it!  This isn't a duel!

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:29.280
The duel that I believe 
in makes everyone happy!

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:54.300
Sora!

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:08.980
Kurosaki is the winner!

00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:17.390
That's enough.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:21.260
I forbid you from taking any 
further action in public.

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:29.670
I need him for experiments to learn 
about Academia's true nature.

00:21:33.360 --> 00:21:37.840
Wait...  The battle isn't over yet...

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:44.700
There's no way I could lose.

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:49.140
I can't lose against an Xyz!

00:21:53.560 --> 00:21:56.000
Wait!  Don't run away!

00:21:56.520 --> 00:22:01.300
Duel me again...

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:03.500
Sora!

00:22:05.160 --> 00:22:06.010
Sora!

00:22:06.500 --> 00:22:08.700
Sora!

00:22:31.250 --> 00:22:35.880
As long as there's a smile

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:42.660
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:47.960
I always believe

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:51.480
In my tomorrow

00:22:51.830 --> 00:22:57.080
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:23:00.380 --> 00:23:05.750
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:12.600
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:12.790 --> 00:23:19.290
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:23.360
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:50.300 --> 00:23:52.680
Sora escaped from his hospital room?

00:23:52.680 --> 00:23:56.240
But he's still hurt from 
his duel against Kurosaki!

00:23:56.240 --> 00:23:59.200
He won't answer our calls either.

00:23:59.200 --> 00:24:01.560
Let's split up and find him.

00:24:01.560 --> 00:24:04.020
I will finish things with Syun Kurosaki!

00:24:04.020 --> 00:24:07.990
I'll prove that I'm stronger 
if I take the duel seriously!

00:24:08.960 --> 00:24:13.360
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Academia and Resistance

00:24:13.360 --> 00:24:15.720
The fun is only getting started!
